# Validate config first
/opt/bin/suricata -c /opt/etc/suricata/suricata.yaml --af-packet -T

# If test passes, start it
/opt/etc/init.d/S50suricata start

# Watch it come up
sleep 5
/opt/etc/init.d/S50suricata status
tail -20 /opt/var/log/suricata/suricata.log

The -T flag does a full config and rules test without actually starting. Paste that output first — if rules load clean we start it live.

